  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "好久不见  (Long Time No See)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xie_ling": "谢灵",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "That evening in a quiet lounge, Chun Yuqiao runs into his former colleague and current rival Xie Ling, whose competing music show tapes in three days. Listen to their icy banter first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "好久不见，你也在这儿？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你不也在这儿呢吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "介绍一下，老同事，淳于乔。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "再过三天就要开始录了，准备好了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我有点替你担心啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果是你的话，就不会担心别人的事了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谢总有进步啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我看是你退步了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果你真的要尹正宇的话，我让给你啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "真的？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "好久不见，你也在这儿？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Long time no see — you are here too?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你不也在这儿呢吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you not right here too?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "介绍一下，老同事，淳于乔。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me introduce him: my old colleague, Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "再过三天就要开始录了，准备好了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'In three more days taping starts — are you ready?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我有点替你担心啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am a little worried on your behalf.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果是你的话，就不会担心别人的事了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If I were in your shoes, I would not worry about other people's business.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谢总有进步啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Director Xie has made progress.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "我看是你退步了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Looks to me like you are the one who has slipped backward.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "如果你真的要尹正宇的话，我让给你啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you really want Yin Zhengyu, I will let you have him.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "真的？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Really?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "好久不见，你也在这儿？",
      "gap": 0.5
