    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "真的？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Why would Chun Yuqiao hand Yin Zhengyu to his fiercest rival? Xie Ling takes the bait, setting off alarm bells back at Xingtian. You learned \"haojiu bu jian\", opposite pair \"jinbu\" and \"tuibu\", and \"zhen de?\".",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "再见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
